# rc4 (2026-10-27): fixed APS5_RESOURCE_CACHE_ENTRIES=4096 (not the adaptive cache of rc2, which was 25 % slower): pf1 showed
# 8.7k resource-cache misses per 10 s with storing templates on (5.2k builds x 185 us + 3.6k BDA x 276 us on the committer),
# while the Deferred pass still makes the worker wait ~0.9 s per 10 s for room. Storing templates + deferred stores on top.
measure 60
base-1 75
st-1 75 switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
dsst-1 75 deferstores on;;switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
base-2 75
st-2 75 switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
dsst-2 75 deferstores on;;switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
